    ANTENNAPARTIALCUTAREA 0.0361 LAYER VIA34 ;
    ANTENNAPARTIALMETALAREA 3.748 LAYER METAL4 ;
    ANTENNAPARTIALMETALSIDEAREA 18.2203 LAYER METAL4 ;
